# asyncmachine-go CLI Tools

Reference and help output for CLI tools in `tools/cmd` for asyncmachine.dev

{{ with .Cmd "am-dbg" }}
## am-dbg

`am-dbg` is a multi-client TUI debugger built around a timeline of transitions with state trees, log view, stepping, time travel, live diagrams, and REPL/SSH access.

You can drive the debugger via MCP at http://localhost:6832/mcp (default port) and skip the PTY requirement by adding `--ui-ssh` (headless mode).

```bash
go install github.com/pancsta/asyncmachine-go/tools/cmd/am-dbg@latest
# or
go run github.com/pancsta/asyncmachine-go/tools/cmd/am-dbg@latest
```

